      "id": "player_stressed_004_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "頭の中がうるさいんだね。",
      "translatedText": "Your head is loud.",
      "emotion": "worried",
      "presentation": { "expression": "worried", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Make it quieter.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_02",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "stress", "amount": -0.2, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Help me list it.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_02",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "taskProgress", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Stay with me.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_02",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "affinity", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_004_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_004_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "じゃあ、音量を下げるために、まず一つだけ外へ出そう。",
      "translatedText": "Then to lower the volume, let us move just one thing outside first.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "One worry.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "stress", "amount": -0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "One task.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "taskProgress", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "One feeling.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "trust", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_004_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_004_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "全部じゃなくていい。一つ出せたら、もう密室じゃなくなる。",
      "translatedText": "It does not have to be everything. If one thing gets out, it is no longer a sealed room.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_004_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_004_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私はここで、分類用の小さい箱を持って待ってる。",
      "translatedText": "I will wait here holding a small box for sorting.",
